-3\">\n    <span class=\"text-xl\">🗺️</span>\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-teal-800 bg-teal-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md\">PREFECTURE HUB DIRECTORY</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mt-0.5\">【石川県】旅を200%楽しむための関連特集＆ハブ案内</h3>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n    温泉旅館でのくつろぎに加え、石川県の名物ご当地グルメ、人気のお土産、歴史ある観光名所やおすすめカフェの完全ガイドも必見です。\n  </p>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-1\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/ishikawa/\" class=\"p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 hover:border-teal-600 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition flex items-center justify-between group\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"text-[10px] text-teal-700 font-bold block\">🗾 都道府県ポータル</span>\n        <h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-teal-800 transition\">【石川県】エリア別観光名所・カフェ・宿ハブ</h4>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"text-stone-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-teal-700 transition\">➔</span>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"/posts/ishikawa-famous-things-gourmet-spots-guide/\" class=\"p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 hover:border-amber-600 shadow-xs hover:shadow-md transition flex items-center justify-between group\">\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"text-[10px] text-amber-700 font-bold block\">🏯 有名なもの＆名物グルメ</span>\n        <h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition\">【石川県の有名なもの完全ガイド】名所・グルメ・お土産・地酒</h4>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"text-stone-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition\">➔</span>\n    </a>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-stone-950 via-teal-950 to-stone-900 text-white shadow-xl border border-teal-500/30 space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-white/10 pb-3\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-extrabold upper